/target
result*
*.lock.tmp
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/corpus
/fuzz/artifacts
/fuzz/coverage
# The coverage report's result link (nix build .#coverage -o coverage), not spec-coverage/.
/coverage
# OpenTofu state belongs in ${XDG_STATE_HOME}/cakeys/cloud (scripts/cloud/*.sh); it names the
# cloud project and account, so a stray copy must never be committed.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# A regeneration waiting beside the golden file it would replace (docs/DEVELOPMENT.md, "Golden
# files"): reviewed and accepted, never committed.
*.new
# Python bytecode of the nix/ scripts that load each other (nix/golden-rows.py, nix/claims.py).
__pycache__/
